:"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:252710","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"はらだ","creatorId":"vndb:s4015","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4015","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4015","name":"はらだ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:162822","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"古月 瓜","creatorId":"vndb:s11178","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11178","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11178","name":"古月瓜","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:162823","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"古月 瓜","creatorId":"vndb:s11178","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11178","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11178","name":"古月瓜","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:162824","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c75879","characterName":"テイル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"68139","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"263739"},{"characterId":"68139","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"297767"},{"characterId":"68139","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"301834"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20384"],"vndbCharacterId":"c75879"},"originalCharacterName":"テイル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"D"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"154"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious girl Eito finds and awakens in a bleak and empty world. She immediately latches on to him as her \"Prince Charming\" and shortly after they are transported to the Great Library. As she has amnesia and remembers nothing about herself, Eito names her \"Tale\" and resolves to stay at the Library until he helps her recover her memories and the story she is the main character of."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tale stays by Eito's side during his adventures and shares a room with him when they rest for the night. She starts a diary soon after she arrives in the hopes it will help to recover her memories as her encounters and experiences with Eito increase."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Friendly, optimistic, positive and easily excited by new things, Tale acts as Eito's emotional support during his adventures. After meeting other characters and registers, she usually attaches the \"chan\" suffix to their first names after meeting them for the first time. Because she has no memory of her past, she is unprejudiced and is always on the lookout to make more friends. She frequently asks Eito and the others about unfamiliar terms and concepts, including those which are inappropriate for someone with the mental age and innocence of a young child."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Tale is really the \"Prima\" of the story Historia wrote with help from Shiori. Grimoire (as Iris) created her based on the template of \"Sleeping heroines awakened by their Prince Charming\". She adores Eito and is physically affectionate with him from the outset."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Although Tale does not have the combat ability of the other characters, her experiences written down in her diary prove to be the solution to the problem of maintaining a story without robbing pages from other stories."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"As her story is all about visits to other tales and her experiences, she is allowed to work as a Librarian and enter other stories as a guest because her tale lacks a significant \"mental imprint\" which could negatively impact the host story if she stays for an excessive period."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In the end, she stays and work by Eito's side in his editorial job and can return freely to the Great Library and her own story via Eito's Colette."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c75879"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"白い砂漠のような世界で拾った女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テイルというのは詠斗がつけてあげた名前。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"記憶喪失状態であり、自分の名前もわからない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"にもかかわらず、それを全く気にした様子は無い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とにかく天真爛漫で、好奇心旺盛かつ能天気。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見るものすべてが新鮮で刺激的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なぜか詠斗のことを王子さまと呼び、人目も憚らず、常に密着しているほどに慕っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20384","sourceWorkId":"27360","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"司書を務める主人公の相棒。様々な物語を巡って成長したが、いつも幸せそうなのは相変わらず。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20384","sourceWorkId":"29051","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"CV：歩サラ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"原画：繭咲悠"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"出典：不明"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身長：154cm"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"カップサイズ：D"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好きなもの：詠斗、知らないもの、珍しいもの"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"白い砂漠のような世界で拾った女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テイルというのは詠斗がつけてあげた名前。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"記憶喪失状態であり、自分の名前もわからない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"にもかかわらず、それを全く気にした様子は無い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とにかく天真爛漫で、好奇心旺盛かつ能天気。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見るものすべてが新鮮で刺激的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なぜか詠斗のことを王子さまと呼び、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人目も憚らず常に密着しているほどに慕っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「王子さまだー！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"68139"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/135970ae381f968b4656f7cd7c1df82a85b078b0d84e71c5ded41445e4b3e8f1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e5f1d566dbe2f1bb32b414a80d972a43adafcb275805d331b0568495a5331dbc.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡本理絵","creatorId":"vndb:s874","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s874","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s874","name":"岡本 理絵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:297767:68139:13368:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c75925","characterName":"イストリア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"68140","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"263739"},{"characterId":"68140","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"297767"},{"characterId":"68140","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"301834"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20385"],"vndbCharacterId":"c75925"},"originalCharacterName":"イストリア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"A"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"144"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Head Librarian of the Great Library, Historia was created around the same time homo sapiens evolved the ability to tell stories from the imagination. Initially she executed her role alone as part of the \"system\" governing the maintenance of the collective gestalt that is the world of stories, but repeated interaction with the characters in stories and the occasional human guest Librarian allowed her to develop human emotions and a personality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Historia has the important role of coalescing stories in their published form from the wellspring of human imagination into books for the Great Library. In addition, she can give form to the fragments of imagination which have not yet been published as stories and materialise them in the Great Library. In this way, she can literally summon food from thin air and obtain the latest entertainment devices from the human world."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"When Shiori is summoned as a Librarian, Historia has recently become acquainted with the new gamut of human emotions but is unsure how to understand them. At Shiori's urging, she endeavours to write her own story which will allow her to understand and cope with human emotions better. Unfortunately her story does not take off and the Register she created, Iris, eventually fades from her consciousness and is presumably destroyed by the worms."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"When Iris and Historia reunite again after the former was thought lost to oblivion, the latter almost succeeds in killing her daughter were it not for the intervention of Eito, Tale and Shiori. After reconciliation, Historia rewards Eito and Shiori for their contributions by making an exception for the pair with regards to their Colletes which are normally returned to the Great Library before humans are sent back."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c75925"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“大図書館”の館長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“現実世界”で物語が発生するのを察知し、それを本の形に結晶化して取り出す能力を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フルネームはイストリア・エーナス・パラティリティス・アナグノースティス・ギデマン・エディトール（フォント小さくしても良いかも）という。自分でつけた。カッコイイから。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"でも誰も呼ばない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大図書館の管理人として機械的に仕事をこなすだけだったが、多くの司書との出会いを経て、永い年月をかけて人間らしさを獲得してきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし最近ではそれが行き過ぎて、司書に多くの仕事を任せて自分はぐーたらしてばかり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近のお気に入りは携帯ゲーム。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20385","sourceWorkId":"27360","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"物語を本の形に結晶化する能力を持つ、大図書館の館長。司書に仕事を任せ、自分はぐーたらしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20385","sourceWorkId":"29051","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"CV：卯衣"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"原画：ぎん太郎"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"出典：なし"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身長：144cm"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"カップサイズ：A"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好きなもの：現実世界の最新知識、詩織の作るお菓子"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“大図書館” の館長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“現実世界” で物語が発生するのを察知し、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それを本の形に結晶化して取り出す能力を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フルネームはイストリア・エーナス・パラティリティス・アナグノースティス・ギデマン・エディトールという。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分でつけた。カッコイイから。でも誰も呼ばない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大図書館の管理人として機械的に仕事をこなすだけだったが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"多くの司書との出会いを経て、永い年月をかけて人間らしさを獲得してきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし最近ではそれが行き過ぎて、司書に多くの仕事を任せて自分はぐーたらしてばかり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近のお気に入りは携帯ゲーム。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「妾はこの図書館そのものじゃ。すごかろう？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"68140"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b720c37a4ec8dbbb747820c2082db43bc02d0450969578ecb7dd69bdd92ecc66.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/32891944fee7ddc701d0e928b317a6fc2270c332dae00221f333b76f377f34d1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大橋歩夕","creatorId":"vndb:s1178","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1178","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1178","name":"大橋 歩夕","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:297767:68140:6174:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c77104","characterName":"かぐや","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"68153","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"263739"},{"characterId":"68153","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"297767"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20962"],"vndbCharacterId":"c77104"},"originalCharacterName":"かぐや","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"C"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The polar opposite to Hourai, Kaguya embraces the tools of modern technology in her quest to be the biggest Yumetuber (Story world Youtube equivalent) personality ever. Her desire to be loved by all has been updated for the modern age, if modern audiences do not know and love Kaguya for her charms, she'll pull out all the stops to make it a reality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She channels the power of her devoted web audience into a blinding glow which helps other characters and the Librarians better attack the worms."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Generally lazy, but if she's sufficiently motivated she can accomplish tasks beyond the scale of most mortals in a short span of time."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Kaguya is exasperated with Hourai's inability to comprehend modern concepts like webcasts, so she's forging ahead with her goal without caring for Hourai's anxiety. Their relationship built over centuries isn't so easy to cast aside, so Kaguya still has the habit of calling Hourai \"Mama\" despite her intentions."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Unlike the other protagonists, Kaguya has not been corrupted by Grimoire's worms. Her selfish desires and childishness do have severe consequences when the Moon Palace is attacked by Grimoire for its pages."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"When Grimoire's assault is fended off, Kaguya hires Eito and Tale as her producers. A big collaborative live concert is eventually planned with four of the other protagonists, but it nearly comes a cropper when Kaguya injures herself during her training regimen. Eito saves the day by taking leave and talking to all of the participants in a bid to keep the practise schedule alive, and the concert goes ahead for the first and only time."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c77104"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"かぐや姫としての義務は、愛されることである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そしてその愛は、より広く、多くの人物から受け取るべきである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"――そう考えたかぐやは、ネット配信を始めた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その場にいながらにして、数多のリブレットに自分の可愛らしさを伝えることが出来る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なんて素晴らしいことなのでしょう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛いの追求には余念のないかぐやなのだが、より刺激的に、扇情的にと求めるあまりに、時折暴走もしてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かぐやの可愛さはもちろんのこと、次は何をしでかすのかと期待しているファンの数も、決して少なくなかったりする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20962","sourceWorkId":"27360","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分のかわいらしさを多くの世界に伝えるため、ネット配信をしているかぐや姫。目立つことが大好き。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20962","sourceWorkId":"29051","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"CV：藤咲ウサ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"原画：ＭｔＵ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"出典：竹取物語（なよ竹のかぐや姫）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身長：159cm"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"カップサイズ：C"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好きなもの：目立つこと、愛されること"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かぐや姫としての義務は、愛されることである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そしてその愛は、より広く、多くの人物から受け取るべきである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"――そう考えたかぐやは、ネット配信を始めた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その場にいながらにして、数多のリブレットに自分の可愛らしさを伝えることが出来る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なんて素晴らしいことなのでしょう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛いの追求には余念のないかぐやなのだが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"より刺激的に、扇情的にと求めるあまりに、時折暴走もしてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かぐやの可愛さはもちろんのこと、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"次は何をしでかすのかと期待しているファンの数も、決して少なくなかったりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ぐーやだよー！今日もよっろしくぅ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"68153"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/37ae5d3f21bdcd8510322a8643f1f18834d8786a12ea8efb7f3098f022bdebc1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/03/031182f5ceb854029ad5cb94130a2ac850dbd0e31c69c1686b01b91d916673b3.webp","width":162,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桜咲千依","creatorId":"vndb:s608","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s608","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s608","name":"藤咲ウサ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:297767:68153:8990:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c87630","characterName":"白雪","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"76108","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"297767"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22081"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87630"},"originalCharacterName":"白雪","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of one of the Grimms' Fairy Tales, \"Snow White\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She believes that she is the most beautiful girl in the world and takes it for granted. However, this is because she doesn't know anything about the outside world. In other words, she is just naive."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's not happy unless she's the best at being \"pretty\" and \"beautiful\". When she's not, she can be pretty dramatic. Other than that, she's an airhead who can easily be influenced, believing everything she's been told. All that said, those are just the results of her innocence, and at heart she's a straightforward and loveable girl."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"The most beautiful girl in the world, Shirayuki, is here! Please let me see your face, my prince—!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87630"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"グリム童話集『白雪姫』のプリマ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天然系過激派自分大好き少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自身が「世界で一番美しい」のだと信じて疑わず当然のことだと思っているが、それは外の世界を知らないが故のもので、つまりはただの世間知らず。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『可愛い』『美しい』において自分が一番でないと気が済まず、そうでない時には強硬手段に出てしまうことも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それ以外のことは頭からっぽで、とても流されやすく、すぐに何でも信じてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただそれらは純粋さの裏返しで、根はまっすぐな愛されキャラ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22081","sourceWorkId":"29051","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"天然系過激派自分大好き少女"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「この世で一番美しいあなたの白雪がまいりました！ お顔をお見せください、王子様ー！」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"グリム童話集『白雪姫』のプリマ。自身が「世界で一番美しい」のだと信じて疑わず当然のことだと思っているが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それは外の世界を知らないが故のもので、つまりはただの世間知らず。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『可愛い』『美しい』において自分が一番でないと気が済まず、そうでない時には強硬手段に出てしまうことも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それ以外のことは頭からっぽで、とても流されやすく、すぐに何でも信じてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただそれらは純粋さの裏返しで、根はまっすぐな愛されキャラ。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"76108"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/54/54140d44593a2b758cf681a151f621625bc78cafe1032153f5bc71ee1340e5fc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/23fbce4d49078be24b6441c7a2277f52e85057b39c883c6e071dd8d268415141.webp","width":157,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤田茜","creatorId":"vndb:s8737","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8737","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8737","name":"藤田 茜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:297767:76108:17981:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c76014","characterName":"久里 詠斗","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c76014"},"originalCharacterName":"久里 詠斗","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A high school student who loves stories of all kinds. He even daydreams about old tales and puts his emotions into roleplaying as the characters in a story."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"One afternoon, he is told to think about his career path after graduating from high school. As he is not talented and doesn't have any distinguishing traits besides a love of stories, he goes to the school library, his favourite haunt, to think things over. The teaching assistant Hanami recounts her own experiences about dreams and a career path, and shortly after they part ways Eito is summoned to the Great Library to be the latest Librarian."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Through his experiences as a Librarian, Eito eventually charts his future career path as an editor. He is allowed to keep his Colette, which allows him to retain the connections he made during his stay at the Great Library."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c76014"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/15/1500ee7550b599ae072abca3b0bf89dc8f2de1f9bf27e893fe15ada86403c84a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1d66dd7c2fe464cd32fe7b7b8b8a4134ae8373a54f836529b31b01c8481fc48b.webp","width":154,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c87631","characterName":"グリム","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c87631"},"originalCharacterName":"グリム","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A Register based on the Grimm Brothers, the authors of the original stories within the collection of Grimm's Fairy Tales. She's in charge of all the stories in the collection. Has a dual personality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The personality \"Jacob\" has a boyish air around her and is a bit of a fickle. She's loyal to her desires, likes to play pranks, and is always getting into trouble."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Haaa... I wonder whether this Librarian actually doesn't know anything.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The other personality, \"Wilhelm\", is a bit unreliable. Serious, kind, and gentle, she's a character that symbolizes the stories of Grimm's Fairy Tales. Has a strong desire to do something for others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, she tends to shoulder problems on her own and doesn't care much about herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"...Recently, I noticed that you've been feeling a little down.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87631"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/69/69060eae1874c32ff1769136bc6e63384ccb22ff4afb748591524f27b9752285.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/ee83cbf64bb250f97fa32f7f039bd6a74c31136c1275dc778f535c9596c2feb8.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"あじ 秋刀魚","creatorId":"vndb:s11","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11","name":"前田 恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:83602","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p8074","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:5899","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p8074","name":"ユメミル","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:29051:5899","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p6335","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p6335","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p6335","name":"黙示游戏中文化兴趣小组","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:126614:v27361","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p8074","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p8074","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p8074","name":"ユメミル","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:76550:v27361","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p8074","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p8074","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p8074","name":"ユメミル","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:84814:v27361","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p8074","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p8074","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p8074","name":"ユメミル","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:84815:v27361","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p8074","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p8074","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p8074","name":"ユメミル","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:84816:v27361","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p8074","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p8074","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p8074","name":"ユメミル","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:88463:v27361","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":[],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
